  "description": "The bridge between OutWit.Common.Settings' SecretValue (a settings entry that is a reference to a secret, never the secret) and OutWit.Shared.Secrets' ISecretStore: RevealAsync / SetAsync / ClearAsync extensions that fetch, store and remove the actual value in the operating-system secret store, keeping the settings file free of anything worth stealing. Declare the setting with ValueKind \"Secret\"; take this package where the secret is actually used.",
